{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["Moshe was not able to enter the Tent of Meeting — at the time of its erection." "Because the cloud rested upon it — immediately, to show the preciousness of the Holy One, blessed be He, for Israel. Afterward the cloud would withdraw from inside the Tent and rest upon the Ark, as it is written: ונועדתי שמה ודברתי אתך מבין שני הכרובים. And then Moshe would enter the Tent of Meeting, as it is written: ובבא משה אל אהל מועד לדבר אתו וישמע את הקול וגו׳ מבין שני הכרובים וידבר אליו. And so you find in the Eternal House: ולא יכלו הכהנים לעמוד לשרת מפני הענן כי מלא כבוד ה׳ את בית ה׳ — at the time of the completion of the House, the Holy One, blessed be He, would consecrate it with the cloud, and afterward He would contract His Presence upon the Ark between the poles. And whoever sets his heart to peer into the words of our Creator — let him not stray from the subtleties of the commentary of our master Shlomo, and let him not depart from them, for most of the halakhot and derashot in it are close to the plain sense of Scripture — [derived] from their additions or from changes in expression — and all of them are to be learned. And it is good that you grasp this which I have explained, and also from that do not let your hand rest."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :register {:flags {1 ["the Eternal"]}}, :notes {1 "The bracketed phrase ומיתורם או משינוי appears to be textually uncertain; rendered hyper-literally. 'Our master Shlomo' refers to Rashi."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:44:09.742885398Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}